      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the difference between renovation and remodeling?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Renovation typically refers to restoring or updating an existing space, while remodeling involves changing a room’s structure or layout. Wise Design specializes in full remodels that combine modern function with preserved character."
