      "name": "How much does a basement remodel cost?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The cost of a basement remodel depends on factors like square footage, scope of work, finishes, and whether plumbing or structural changes are needed. Most projects begin at $50,000 and can increase depending on customization. We provide a detailed estimate after reviewing your goals and design priorities so you can plan with confidence."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How to plan a basement renovation?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The best way to start planning is by identifying how you want to use the space. Do you need additional bedrooms? A workout area? A flexible entertainment zone? From there, our design-build team will help create a layout that maximizes functionality, brings in natural light, and integrates storage. We’ll also guide you through material selections and construction planning for a stress-free process."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much value does a basement remodel add?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A finished basement adds significant livable square footage, which can increase both your home’s functionality and market value. Depending on the scope, homeowners can often recoup a substantial portion of their investment when selling, while also enjoying years of added comfort in the meantime."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I contact Wise Design basement contractors?",
