      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a basement remodel?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A basement remodel is the process of transforming an unfinished or outdated lower level into a fully functional, comfortable living space. At Wise Design & Remodel, this could mean creating a guest suite, home office, gym, media lounge, or family gathering space—always designed to feel like a seamless extension of your home."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do I need a permit to remodel my basement?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes, most basement remodels in St. Paul and the surrounding Twin Cities require permits—especially if the project involves plumbing, electrical work, or structural changes. As your contractor, we handle all permits and inspections to ensure your remodel meets local building codes."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is it worth it to remodel a basement?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Absolutely. Remodeling your basement is one of the most cost-effective ways to expand your living space without building an addition. Whether you’re creating a rental suite, a kids’ play area, or a home theater, a remodel maximizes the potential of square footage you already own."
